Note: You cannot clear an existing role.', example='xianwen-test-ram-role'),
      systemDisk?: {
        category?: string(name='Category', description='The disk category. Valid values:

- cloud_essd: ESSD.', example='cloud_essd'),
        encrypted?: boolean(name='Encrypted', description='Specifies whether to encrypt the system cloud disk. Valid values:
- true: The system cloud disk is encrypted.
- false: The system cloud disk is not encrypted.

